  <name>MimOffice Karbon</name>
  <summary>Scalable Graphics</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Karbon is a vector graphics drawing application, well suited to creating
      illustrations, diagrams, and scalable artwork. Karbon is part of MimOffice, a
      rebrand of KDE Calligra maintained by XI14.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Vector drawing and path editing tools</li>
      <li>SVG import/export</li>
      <li>OpenDocument Graphics (ODG) support</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
